          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Gladiator protein powder is a genuinely good product: 45 g of protein per serving from whey isolate, hydrolysate, casein and egg, a published amino acid profile, a lean macro profile and NSF Certified for Sport status confirmed in the registry. For Smoothie King regulars and tested athletes, there is little on the label to object to beyond sucralose and the soy allergen.
